/-
# HM Theorem 0.3 for `f_{2,3,2}` at the χ₀ points (generated by `scripts/mtc_gap/gen_zeros232.py`)

`q = t^{36}` (`t = Q^{1/6}`, `Q` the variable of χ₀), `y = −t^{6b}`. For each `b`, `F ∈ Th(11)` vanishes at 9 zeros of
`j(B)` (`x³ = −…`, coefficients `Z^{42}, Z^{14}, Z^{70}`) and 3 zeros of `j(A)`, pairwise inequivalent under
`x ↦ t^{180} x`, so `F = 0` and HM Theorem 0.3 holds at every good `x`.
-/
